        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/325631d22c1f0d0272dcbc3bac8773e5.avif?t=1776979729\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras_big/325631d22c1f0d0272dcbc3bac8773e5.avif?t=1776979729 width=800 height=124 /></span><strong>Collect Your Toothpicks!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Life’s pretty straightforward when you’re a ceramic toothpick holder. But what’s a pig to do in a brand new kitchen? That'll take the help of some new friends and a couple well-timed acrobatic feats!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Gameplay Features Overview</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Acrobatic Platforming Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Missions, Puzzles, Racing, and Platforming Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features Responsive Tutorials and Visible Input Displays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wholesome and Charming NPC Dialogue Interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Exciting New Ways to Traverse the Kitchen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a Beautiful Detailed Kitchen Environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu Setting Options, Auto Saving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Environmental Audio and Dynamic Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Gamepad Controller Support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/6e86b06090dc207d39a3c0d50f506e80.poster.avif?t=1776979729\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/6e86b06090dc207d39a3c0d50f506e80.webm?t=1776979729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/6e86b06090dc207d39a3c0d50f506e80.mp4?t=1776979729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Your New Countertop Companions </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This kitchen is full of countertop characters who can't wait to meet the newest arrival! (it's you!)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Culinary World From a Whole New Perspective </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As the saying goes, &quot;The world is your toothpick!&quot;- or that's what this piggy toothpick holder tells us (we'll have to fact check him on it).</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flip, Fling, and Fly Your Way to Daring New Heights! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Begin fun and challenging quests as you meet new friends and discover all new ways to explore the kitchen from top to bottom! After all, &quot;There are toothpicks everywhere for those with eyes to see!&quot; (okay, that one can't be true)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/c496807f1021ed1d761f6f2a02dbcfc6.poster.avif?t=1776979729\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/c496807f1021ed1d761f6f2a02dbcfc6.webm?t=1776979729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/c496807f1021ed1d761f6f2a02dbcfc6.mp4?t=1776979729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Explore the lore! a pig game was inspired by PineyWoods Corner's Pee Wee Polka Dotted Pig!</i></h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/325631d22c1f0d0272dcbc3bac8773e5.avif?t=1776979729\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras_big/325631d22c1f0d0272dcbc3bac8773e5.avif?t=1776979729 width=800 height=124 /></span><strong>Collect Your Toothpicks!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Life’s pretty straightforward when you’re a ceramic toothpick holder. But what’s a pig to do in a brand new kitchen? That'll take the help of some new friends and a couple well-timed acrobatic feats!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Gameplay Features Overview</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Acrobatic Platforming Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Missions, Puzzles, Racing, and Platforming Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features Responsive Tutorials and Visible Input Displays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wholesome and Charming NPC Dialogue Interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Exciting New Ways to Traverse the Kitchen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a Beautiful Detailed Kitchen Environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu Setting Options, Auto Saving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Environmental Audio and Dynamic Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Gamepad Controller Support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/6e86b06090dc207d39a3c0d50f506e80.poster.avif?t=1776979729\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/6e86b06090dc207d39a3c0d50f506e80.webm?t=1776979729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/6e86b06090dc207d39a3c0d50f506e80.mp4?t=1776979729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Your New Countertop Companions </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This kitchen is full of countertop characters who can't wait to meet the newest arrival! (it's you!)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Culinary World From a Whole New Perspective </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As the saying goes, &quot;The world is your toothpick!&quot;- or that's what this piggy toothpick holder tells us (we'll have to fact check him on it).</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flip, Fling, and Fly Your Way to Daring New Heights! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Begin fun and challenging quests as you meet new friends and discover all new ways to explore the kitchen from top to bottom! After all, &quot;There are toothpicks everywhere for those with eyes to see!&quot; (okay, that one can't be true)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/c496807f1021ed1d761f6f2a02dbcfc6.poster.avif?t=1776979729\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/c496807f1021ed1d761f6f2a02dbcfc6.webm?t=1776979729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/c496807f1021ed1d761f6f2a02dbcfc6.mp4?t=1776979729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Explore the lore! a pig game was inspired by PineyWoods Corner's Pee Wee Polka Dotted Pig!</i></h2>",
